quran[11]{c,v,t}:
  33,63,People ask you about the Hour. Say: ‘Its knowledge is only with Allah. What shall make you know? Perhaps the Hour is near.’
  33,64,"Indeed, Allah has cursed the disbelievers and prepared a Blazing Fire for them."
  33,65,They will remain in it forever. They will find neither any guardian nor any helper.
  33,66,"The Day when their faces are turned about in the Fire, they will say: ‘Oh! If only we had obeyed Allah and obeyed the Messenger (blessings and peace be upon him)!’"
  33,67,"And they will say: ‘Our Lord, indeed we obeyed our leaders and (the influential) elders. So they led us astray from the (right) way."
  33,68,Our Lord! Give them a twofold punishment and curse them with a tremendous curse.’
  33,69,"O believers! Do not be like those who slandered Musa (Moses), whereas Allah cleared him of what they alleged. And he was highly honourable in Allah’s sight."
  33,70,O believers! Be God-conscious and speak an upright word.
  33,71,He shall rectify for you your deeds and forgive you your sins. Whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger (blessings and peace be upon him) has undoubtedly achieved great success.
  33,72,"Indeed, We offered (Our) trust to the heavens, the earth and the mountains, but they refused to bear this (burden) and were afraid of it. Yet human being undertook it. Indeed, he has proved himself very unfair (in keeping the trust) and highly ignorant (of the consequence of his negligence)."
  33,73,"(It is) so that Allah may punish the hypocritical men and the hypocritical women and the polytheist men and the polytheist women, and Allah may turn in mercy to the believing men and the believing women, and Allah is Most-Forgiving, All-Merciful."
